SUMMARY:CANCELLED: The Willow Snags Live
DESCRIPTION:The Willow Snags (Sacramento\, CA) are a rock band rooted in the blues and psychedelia of the 1960s. Typically found performing 2 – 3 hour sets in local haunts and dive bars in the Sacramento area\, The Willow Snags had the honor of opening up for the legendary 4 Non Blondes at the Great American Music Hall on 12/17/2025. \nFeaturing the talents of UC Davis alumni Mia Mercado on electric organ/vocals\, UC Davis alumni Diego Martinez-Campos on percussion\, Joshua Williams on lead guitar\, Marisol Werner on rhythm guitar\, and Johnny Mercado on vocals. \n$15 General Admission\nConcert starts at 8:00pm\nDoors open at 7:30pm\nThis is a BYOB Event!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/the-willow-snags-live/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd\, Suite #1\, Davis\, California\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
