SUMMARY:Summer Soiree: Farm to Table Benefit for CAFF
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening among the golden hills and lush fields of Full Belly Farm\, an organic gem nestled in the heart of the Capay Valley. CAFF’s Summer Soiree is our annual celebration of the farmers\, food\, and communities at the heart of everything we do. \nThis year\, we’re celebrating the women at the heart of it all. The United Nations has declared 2026 the International Year of the Woman Farmer\, honoring the essential yet too often unrecognized contributions of women across our food system. At CAFF’s Summer Soiree\, we’re bringing that recognition to life. \nFeast on delicious food sourced from women farmers and ranchers\, sip on wines and seasonal libations crafted by women artisans\, and raise a glass while we enjoy talks from women leaders and live music from women artists. \nCAFF has long stood alongside women farmers\, and on July 25th\, we’re honoring their work\, their resilience\, and their leadership in building the food system we all depend on. \nEvery ticket purchased\, every raffle ticket bought\, every dollar donated is a direct investment in that work. Your presence at the Soiree supports CAFF’s advocacy and programs that strengthen women-led farms\, all while building more resilient communities across California. \nCome hungry\, come ready to celebrate\, and come knowing that a beautiful evening on one of our favorite farms is also a powerful act of solidarity with the women who feed our world.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/summer-soiree-farm-to-table-benefit-for-caff/
LOCATION:Full Belly Farm\, 15730 County Road 43\, Guinda\, C\, 95637\, United States
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/SUMMER-SOIREE-9.jpg
END:VEVENT
