SUMMARY:Adrian West Band Live
DESCRIPTION:Adrian West Band is a rising force in the Bay Area music scene. Based in Oakland\, the six-piece band plays original acoustic rock which they dub “Paul Simon meets Talking Heads”. A classically trained violinist who later turned to drums\, guitar and singing\, Adrian is a gifted composer and arranger. His lyrics\, which range from whimsical to philosophical\, ride atop a steady wave of catchy music. He always writes the music first and lyrics second\, only adding lyrics if he feels the music stands tall on its own. Fun fact: Paul Simon and David Byrne (of Talking Heads) work pretty much the same way. \nAdrian figured out a while ago that he likes having trained jazz musicians in his band. Jazz musicians bring technical chops and versatility. They know how to listen to each other and make a song flourish. And so to keep things interesting (for bandmembers and audience alike)\, the band also plays riveting renditions of cool Jazz standards — not the esoteric stuff\, but rather tunes with approachable melodies that even non-experienced Jazz listeners can enjoy. \nTo top it off\, the band throws in a rock cover or two … anything from Supertramp to Dolly Parton. \nThis concert will feature a six-piece ensemble\, bringing together some top Bay Area talent (musicians listed below). The rip-roaring solos of pianist Michael Echaniz are worth the price of admission alone. Their performance will take you to new heights fueled by vocal harmonies\, acoustic guitar\, electric violin\, piano\, alto sax\, upright bass\, drums and live looping. You will leave wanting more\, but knowing you’ve witnessed something new and special. \nBYOB! Visit www.adrianwest.com for more information including live performance videos and audio recordings. \nThe musicians:\nAdrian West – vocals\, acoustic guitar\, elec. violin & live looping\nLarisa Roberts – vocals\, percussion\nMichael Echaniz – piano\nChris Haag – alto sax\nAaron Germain – upright bass\nShawn Urbi-Tennie – drums \n$20 General Admission\n$15 Students (w/student ID\, in-store or at the door only)\nKids under 12 FREE\nShow starts at 8:00pm\nDoors open at 7:30pm
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/adrian-west-band-live/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd\, Suite #1\, Davis\, California\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Backroom-6-piece-hi-res-w-logo-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:watermelonmusicdavis@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
